🚩 - user claims space 
➖ - negates a claimed space sets a flag for user that placed it 
♾️- user maintains space for entire game
🧟- at the end of the round crawls back to the top of the space. 
☠️ - user claims space all existing zombies in space are negated
↔️ - user moves current stack to left or right (chosen)
↕️ - user moves deck up or down (chosen)
➡️ - user moves deck x spaces right
⬅️ - user moves stack x spaces left
⬆️ - user moves stacks x spaces up
⬇️ - user moves stack x spaces down
↖️ - user moves stack spaces diag left
↙️ - user moves stack x spaces diag left
↘️ - user moves stack x spaces diag right
↗️ - user moves stack x spaces diag up right 
⏫️ - bring bottom card to top of stack
⏬️ - move top tile to bottom of stack
⏹️ - stops all effects in stack 
🔄 - reshuffle stack
🌱 - continues to grow through stack. After 1 turn on top evolves into:
🌿 - intermediate no immediate effects continues to grow
🍀 - allows user to draw an extra tiles continues to grow
Intermediate plants can evolve into:
🌸 - has effect with bee
🐝 - allow user to plant new seedling for each flower
🌵 - only destroyed by nuke, or bombs
🌳 - allows user to place one more seedling whe reached
🪓 - chips down plants. When chopping a non tree reclaims space, when it’s a tree leaves a stump 🪵
🍄 - when played as is allows user to spread an additional mushroom at the end of a round, when applied to stump (user can chop own tree) all user plants become a mushroom. (Allowing additional mushroom for each plant)
🪨 - user claims space only destroyed by pickaxe bomb nuke
⛏️ - destroy other user stone, or convert own stone into 🗿
🗿 - cannot be destroyed 
💣  - destroy all stacks in 1 tile radius place flag on spot 
🔫 - destroy 1 tile stack
🧨 - destroy all stack in 3 tile radius claim 4 tiles from radius
🌪️ - design a path for destruction, must end on edge of board
☢️ - all user poops become germs/ activate germ effect 
🚽 - destroy row or colum
